@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+- Members may have up to 15 holds by default (`max_holds`), and the refusal says how many they have.
 - Loans of the materials in the new `limit_exempt` option (default `MAG`) no longer count towards the loan limit.
 - The members export writes the born and joined dates as DD/MM/YYYY for the mailing house.
 - Fixed: a payment larger than the balance was taken and left the member in credit; it is now refused (`overpayment`).
